mapping "V1200.1" source="V1200" target="295981000000108" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V1200 (Swedish extension of V12.0) = driver of pedal cycle injured in non-traffic
        collision with two-/three-wheeled motor vehicle, during sport/exercise. Activity suffix has no
        SNOMED CT analogue. Target SNOMED CT 44791623 (code 295981000000108) = SNOMED CT 295981000000108, active
